<section class="sec" id="aosf" data-palette="3">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Strategic Infrastructure</div>
    <h2 data-reveal data-delay=".08">Meet <em>AOSF</em> —<br />the Harness Layer</h2>
    <p class="lede" data-reveal data-delay=".16">The <a href="https://aosf.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Agentic Open Source Foundation</a> provides the orchestration core that makes A2App possible. In the four-layer model of agentic software production, AOSF owns the most strategic position: the Harness — the layer that controls everything beneath it.</p>

    <div class="aosf-grid">
      <div class="card aosf-layer" data-reveal data-delay=".2">
        <div class="layer-num">01 / SPEC LAYER</div>
        <h3>Human defines intent <span class="tag tag-pink">Human</span></h3>
        <p>Intent, requirements, and acceptance criteria. Where every project begins — the human articulates what needs to be built.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card aosf-layer featured" data-reveal data-delay=".26">
        <div class="layer-num">02 / HARNESS LAYER</div>
        <h3>Orchestration &amp; workflow <span class="tag tag-mint">AOSF Core ★</span></h3>
        <p>The strategic control plane. AOSF owns the workflow engine, agent coordination, and process IP. <strong>Who controls the Harness, controls the economy.</strong> Agents are replaceable — the Harness is not.</p>
        <a class="link-pill" href="https://aosf.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit AOSF →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card aosf-layer" data-reveal data-delay=".32">
        <div class="layer-num">03 / AGENT LAYER</div>
        <h3>AI execution <span class="tag tag-indigo">Replaceable</span></h3>
        <p>Coding agents, test agents, security agents. The AI workers that carry out tasks — orchestrated by the Harness. GPT, Claude, Gemini: swap freely.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card aosf-layer" data-reveal data-delay=".38">
        <div class="layer-num">04 / VERIFICATION LAYER</div>
        <h3>Quality assurance <span class="tag tag-dim">Automated</span></h3>
        <p>Static analysis, formal verification, and fuzzing. Every agent output is validated before release — correctness proven, not just tested.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card aosf-insight" data-reveal data-delay=".44">
        <div class="insight-label">Key insight</div>
        <div class="insight-list">
          <p><strong>We don't own agents</strong> — they're replaceable commodities. The model you use today will be superseded tomorrow.</p>
          <p><strong>We own the Harness</strong> — process IP, governance framework, and quality standards. Strategic, durable competitive advantage.</p>
          <p><strong>We invest in token compute</strong> — not offices, engineers, or code repos. A true asset-light factory model.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
